{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0092_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7628a46bad008be5ce689d155c84c4b8d5daf85dc4f4285afcff3514124f126a", "ja": "（雑誌のグラビア撮影で、地方までやってきた。\n今は、休憩時間なわけだが……）", "zh": "（为了拍摄杂志的写真照，我们来到外县市。\n现在是休息时间……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0092_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "53896afc3a03aaae9c6d071b5ccea9c8297ca54c96f3daef9cba5cbf3d7d19f4", "ja": "猫にマタタビ～♪　可奈は良い旅～♪\n{$P$}さん、楽しいですねー！", "zh": "猫咪喜欢木天蓼～♪可奈要行万里路～♪\n{$P$}先生，旅行很快乐对吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0092_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0626d82d8f774ce9ddaf06a61a57b1dc9e10a7b9a25e86e2bd7b5d8bb24287d0", "ja": "ああ……楽しいけど、けっこう歩くな……。\nふぅ。", "zh": "是啊……但快乐归快乐，也走了不少路呢……\n呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0092_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "92dbf69986575a08eb3596848768f5462e60b1713155e5c2800f8d2509bd5108", "ja": "はれっ？　{$P$}さん、\nなんだか疲れてませんか？", "zh": "咦？{$P$}先生，\n你是不是累了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0092_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f45fb8cdfde077b66b37967fe93d8e7466fe255a566fb47a39915f7445913184", "ja": "久しぶりに、こんなに歩いたからな……。\nそう言う可奈は、疲れてないのか？", "zh": "因为我很久没走这么多路了……\n倒是可奈，你不累吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0092_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "b3fe89faf621a4682c59817eb3e0063fc51d76fa274f2488ddfba71548e50a64", "ja": "私は、まだまだ元気でーす！\n最近、運動してもあんまり疲れないんですよ～。", "zh": "我还很有精神喔──！\n最近就算运动过后也不怎么累呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0092_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "dfabcaa0fc486633d6bb48f73cd7ec6db86b8f3791d6ee7066462b96fffe83f7", "ja": "毎日、劇場でレッスンをしてるからかな？\n体力がついてきたみたいです！", "zh": "是因为每天都在剧场训练的关系吗？\n我的体能好像变强了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0092_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e6f6e966890c084215e6715b71907ee2cffeb93a306dc1ac1e77f3450933dc8c", "ja": "確かに、アイドルは体力勝負だからな。\n俺も見習わないと。", "zh": "的确，毕竟偶像是靠体能决胜负的职业嘛。\n我也得向你看齐才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0092_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "cc632f6f08f786bb7c71a68df2d0f76572be96df4c6d4ac6a09e10c95989866b", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、一緒に運動ですね！\nでも、今日のところは……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生也一起来运动吧！\n不过，今天就先不勉强……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0092_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "faf09b8c584e8be8b90886da80161bbf9d5c1a56e98ac1ca6dbb7f316c665931", "ja": "疲れたら、私が引っ張ってってあげます！\n車掌さんの可奈が案内しますよ～、えへっ♪", "zh": "要是你累了，就让我拉你一把吧！\n可奈车掌来帮你带路啰～嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
